{"title":"Gifted mathematics","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gifted_Math_Websites\">Gifted Math Websites</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_mathematics&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Gifted Math Websites\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a> (AoPS) hosts this <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPSWiki\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPSWiki\">AoPSWiki</a> and many other resources for bright students of mathematics.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/\">Homepage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cut-the-knot&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Cut-the-knot (page does not exist)\">Cut-the-knot</a> hosts an enormous amount of great math material and games that are best used by gifted math students.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.cut-the-knot.org/index.shtml\">Homepage</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_mathematics&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_enrichment\" title=\"Mathematics enrichment\">Mathematics enrichment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_programs\" title=\"Gifted programs\">Gifted programs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_websites\" title=\"Gifted websites\">Gifted websites</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_education\" title=\"Gifted education\">Gifted education</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_summer_programs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics summer programs\">Mathematics summer programs</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018085657\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1570:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018085657 and revision id 3543. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}